                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Poor puzzle design shortened this game to about 1 hour of gameplay.   Not too excited about that.\n\nI went back and beat the space puzzle.  The solution was very ridiculous and illogical.  Apparently, in whatever country this game is from, batteries and physics work very differently.  Or not at all.  After playing a little further I found that I couldn't climb a ladder leading to a turret to defend the stargate.  \n\nASRECorp started out with promise, but failed to remain consistent.  Don't try this game.",
